counterexample:
Reading the required parameters inside the lock, releasing the lock, executing the network call, and then re-acquiring the lock to apply the result:
```rust
fn process_payment_clean(mutex: &Mutex<Account>) {
    let card_info = {
        let guard = mutex.lock().unwrap();
        guard.card_info().clone() // Read quickly, release lock immediately
    };
    let status = make_http_payment_request(card_info); // Safe, network call outside lock
    let mut guard = mutex.lock().unwrap();
    guard.set_status(status);
}
